This license covers the original contribution in this repository: the
`iFogSim/src/org/paper2/` package, the `src/*.py` analysis and reproduction
scripts, and this repository's own documentation.

The base simulator under `iFogSim/` (everything outside `org/paper2/`) is a
fork of iFogSim2 (github.com/Cloudslab/iFogSim, commit 5f68d39) and remains
under its own MIT license, reproduced unchanged at `iFogSim/LICENSE.txt`
(Copyright (c) 2025 The Cloud Computing and Distributed Systems (CLOUDS)
Laboratory). Two of its files were modified for this project
(`src/org/fog/entities/ControllerComponent.java`,
`src/org/fog/entities/MicroserviceFogDevice.java`) and one file was added
in that same base package (`src/org/fog/entities/ServiceDiscovery.java`);
these carry the base project's original license, consistent with how the
base project itself is licensed.
